      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Status: CircuitNet patch preparation and SFT/GRPO code are scaffolded; model training has not been run. The CircuitNet GRPO objective improves congestion prediction, not route generation. ISPD/OpenROAD route parsing, candidate routing, physical DRC/PPA rewards, and real-design evaluation remain future work.",
